<title>PORTUGAL: Portugal 6-month budget deficit down 16 pct yr/yr.</title>
<headline>Portugal 6-month budget deficit down 16 pct yr/yr.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1997-07-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Portugal's budget deficit over the first six months of 1997 was down 16 percent from the same period last year at 202.8 billion escudos, the Finance Ministry said in its monthly bulletin.</p>
<p>&quot;The deficit is on track to comply with the 1997 budget forecast,&quot; it said.  </p>
<p>The Finance Ministry said a reduction in interest rates and a rise in tax receipts helped to reduce the deficit.</p>
<p>-- Lisbon editorial +(351-1) 3538254</p>
</text>
